  "document_text": "# Acme Analytics Engine\n\nAcme Analytics Engine is a streaming database auditing platform for enterprise data teams.\n\n## Core capabilities\n\nAcme Analytics Engine provides real-time database auditing with sub-millisecond latency. It processes over 100,000 events per second and reduces operational cost for data teams. Acme Analytics Engine serves enterprise data teams and integrates with Snowflake.\n\n## Pricing and delivery\n\nPricing starts from $2,000 per month, delivered in a four-step onboarding process with a 30-day money-back guarantee. Book a demo to see it running on your data. Get started in three steps.\n\n## Proof and trust\n\nAvailability is 99.99%, measured by Jane Doe from the Acme Corporation standards team and documented as SOC 2 Type II. Read the [streaming data guide](/guides/streaming-data) and the [pricing page](/pricing). Setup details live in the [onboarding documentation](/docs/onboarding).\n",
